> You’ll obtain the Legendary Animals Map from Hosea during the story mission Exit Pursued by a Bruised Ego early in Chapter 2. The map will indicate the general location of these unique animals in the map,[ though] finding them will require several steps[.]
First[, you] have[ to] enter the legendary animal[�]�s territory[.] You�[�ll] get a prompt in the upper left corner of your screen if you�[�]re within one[.] Once you�[�re] inside the territory[,] the next part is finding your first clue[.] Legendary animals will always have up to 3-4 clues[ that] you have[ to] track[ and] discover in order[.] Fortunately[,] the first clues are[ always] found in the same spots, making it easier to track them. Use your Eagle Eye to find the yellow particles leading to a clue[.] Keep an eye out for a small question mark in your radar as well as it indicates the exact spot of the first clue[.] Once you examine the first[ clue, it]’[s] recommended to apply the Cover Scent Lotion to hide your[ scent].
If there’s too much activity like random encounters, gunfights, story events, etc[,] the legendary animal won’t spawn in the area. If this is the case[, you]’[ll] have to leave the territory for a couple of days[ then come] back later. Camping in the vicinity doesn’t seem to work and you’ll have to travel a certain distance away from the territory to �[�]refresh” it.
After finding and interacting with the first clue[, it]’s all about following the tracks and interacting with the following clues. Once[ Arthur] says that the creature �[�]must be near”[,] use your[ Eagle] Eye and scan the surroundings. The tracks[ should] lead to the legendary animal within shooting range[.] As long[ as] it doesn’t smell you or you don’t[ sp]ook it[, you can] attempt to get a bit closer to have clear shots. Most legendary animals will flee so you have to make sure your shots count.
Legendary animals will always drop their legendary skin/pelts and parts no[ matter what weapon you] use. As such, it’s recommended to use your most powerful guns and rounds against legendary animals when hunting them, especially the most dangerous ones and the larger ones.
