]Here�[�]s how it works[:] Invite your friends,[ family] or co-[workers] to join the challenge[.] Fill out your March Madness brackets[.]
[Based] on whether your chosen teams win or lose, you do the corresponding[ number] of[ reps] of a certain exercise[.]
Win[ners] do fewer[ reps]; Losers do more. Everybody gets in shape.
